===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*deuʀ}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*deuzą}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*dʰewsóm}}.

Germanic cognates include {{cog|ofs|diār}}, {{cog|osx|dior}}, {{cog|odt|dier}}, {{cog|goh|tior}}, {{cog|non|dýr}}, {{cog|got|𐌳𐌹𐌿𐍃}}. Further cognates include {{cog|lt|dvēsti}} and {{cog|ru|душа́}}.

